Humboldt Research Fellowship Programme for Experienced Researchers


Dear Dr. Siam,


Thank you very much for your application for a Humboldt Research Fellowship=
 for Experienced Researchers, which was thoroughly examined within the scop=
e of the selection process. We regret to inform you that at this time, we a=
re unable to consider it for formal reasons, since we have not received a s=
tatement from your proposed host and confirmation that research facilities =
and support will be made available to you.


We thank you for your interest in the Alexander von Humboldt Foundation and=
 its programmes and wish you all the best for your academic future.


Yours sincerely,


